[statement]
A package needed through a name it provides at a version waits for what
needed it, but is not freed by it: `x`, which `y` needed through `v`, is
removed after everything else, `b`'s install included. One providing the
name at no version would follow `y` at once.

[repository]
P:b
V:1

[installed]
P:x
V:1
p:v=1

P:y
V:1
D:v

P:z
V:1

[request]
b

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
remove y 1
remove z 1
install b 1
remove x 1
